Description: Estimates the annual probabilities of stalls, upswings and
    reversals in the fertility transitions (SURFs) from a sample from the
    posterior distribution of annual total fertility rates (e.g., as produced by
    'bayesTFR'). Plotting, tabulation, and sensitivity analysis functionality is
    also provided.    
